{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/11621fadab09c684e1a3e3c9806c0e89.avif?t=1772880465\" width=380 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/72bed649c4d49b90b98c8983f45881e5.avif?t=1772880465\" width=379 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/563cf62453abef0434417e92f46708cf.avif?t=1772880465\" width=379 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/d1d343f063416660ed70fa57e0e7b304.avif?t=1772880465\" width=380 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/1c874a416cbdccc13efc064137f5d837.avif?t=1772880465\" width=380 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your dream bakery, make friends with adorable animals, collect friendship photos and unique scrapbook elements. Forge ahead, using the power of baking to solve the town\u2019s challenges. Let every animal enjoy its favorite bread\u2014and open up about the secrets they\u2019ve kept hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/5c4634c617a19b1a922893b5a872171e.poster.avif?t=1772880465\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/5c4634c617a19b1a922893b5a872171e.webm?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/5c4634c617a19b1a922893b5a872171e.mp4?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box Bakery</strong> is a cozy and heartwarming simulation game where you step into the shoes of a newcomer baker, running your very own dream bakery. In the charming town of <strong>Greenfield</strong>, you'll create delightful and inventive breads to meet the tastes of the local residents, all while unlocking new, unique recipes and building the bakery of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is rich and diverse:<br>\ud83e\udd50 <strong>Simulation Management</strong>: Greet customers every day, listen to their stories and worries, bake each loaf by hand, and stock your shelves with care. Expand your shop, unlock new equipment, and decorate to your heart\u2019s content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/f023531b57bb6e2045f11ce48713fd72.poster.avif?t=1772880465\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/f023531b57bb6e2045f11ce48713fd72.webm?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/f023531b57bb6e2045f11ce48713fd72.mp4?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Collection System</strong>: Collect friendship photos and journal elements that capture the small yet meaningful moments you share with the townsfolk. Each conversation deepens your bond, unlocking new stories and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/ed2af409579e9bef37629171daca8e36.poster.avif?t=1772880465\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/ed2af409579e9bef37629171daca8e36.webm?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/ed2af409579e9bef37629171daca8e36.mp4?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Puzzles &amp; Quests</strong>: Help solve the worries and problems of the townspeople, from sourcing mysterious ingredients to discovering hidden recipes. Every quest brings new inspiration and challenges to your bakery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/ab6ae0dcb17ecf780f4bb5e818158924.poster.avif?t=1772880465\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/ab6ae0dcb17ecf780f4bb5e818158924.webm?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/ab6ae0dcb17ecf780f4bb5e818158924.mp4?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it comes to the story atmosphere, <strong>Box Bakery</strong> emphasizes warmth, comfort, and a strong sense of community. Every customer has a story\u2014perhaps a little fox searching for the taste of their childhood, or a bear longing to reconcile with their family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/bddaf1f6c04af05064a2f98e3921b446.poster.avif?t=1772880465\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/bddaf1f6c04af05064a2f98e3921b446.webm?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/bddaf1f6c04af05064a2f98e3921b446.mp4?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the comforting aroma of bread, you\u2019ll become the \u201cheart baker\u201d for the town\u2019s residents, helping them open up and rediscover the small joys of life. There\u2019s no intense competition or stressful time crunch here\u2014just a peaceful, cozy bakery and a heart that\u2019s always ready to listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/c98914faa65a548805283df671700d57.poster.avif?t=1772880465\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/c98914faa65a548805283df671700d57.webm?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942950/extras/c98914faa65a548805283df671700d57.mp4?t=1772880465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer a leisurely business simulation or heartwarming stories, you\u2019ll find your own slice of \u201cbread time\u201d here at <strong>Box Bakery</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"This game isn't played like this","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942950/6bdd36d92c469e6217fd9159ee4239e8edb61837.jpg"},{"name":"This game really isn't played like this","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea